The country table shipped in src/webmeta/data/countries.json, and the table
webmeta builds at run time, contain data from:

- Natural Earth (https://www.naturalearthdata.com/): admin-0 countries and map
  units, 1:10m. Public domain.
- Unicode CLDR (https://cldr.unicode.org/): territory information (languages and
  their population shares). Copyright (c) Unicode, Inc. Unicode License v3,
  https://www.unicode.org/license.txt
- ISO 639-3 code table, SIL International as registration authority
  (https://iso639-3.sil.org/), used to map two-letter to three-letter language codes.
